                        <cell role="num">$3,000,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>8.</cell>
                        <cell>Budget, 1922—Including Public Schools</cell>
                        <cell>$3,000,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>9.</cell>
                        <cell>Required 1922 to continue work Public Roads</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$1,200,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>Recruit Policia Nacional Dominicana to strength necessary to enable
