                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>10. To stabilize Dominican finances, wipe out deficit, continue work on roads,
                    and procure funds to recruit Policia Nacional Dominicana, Military Governor
                    proposes to negotiate a $10,000,000 twenty year loan, noncallable for eight
                    years and with no provision for amortization for the same length of time (or
                    until expiration of 1908 loan) and to extend the duties of the General
                    Receivership to the service of the loan.—$7,500,000 loan to be floated
                    immediately and the remainder as required.</p>
                <p>11. The $7,500,000 to be expended as follows: <table cols="5" rows="7">
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#middle" rows="7">1922</cell>
                            <cell role="brace" rows="7">{</cell>
                            <cell>Wipe out internal indebtedness</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell role="num">$1,050,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Redeem 1918 and 1921 bonds</cell>
                            <cell/>
                            <cell role="num">4,000,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Public Works</cell>
                            <cell role="brace" rows="3">}</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#middle" role="num" rows="3">1,500,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Guardia Nacional</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Agriculture</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell cols="2">Meet Tobacco acceptances</cell>
                            <cell rendition="#border-bottom" role="num">950,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell cols="2">Total</cell>
                            <cell role="num">$7,500,000</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <pb facs="0123" n="9" xml:id="pg9"/>
